{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0026-s001", "text": "En frisk människa mår bra fysiskt, psykiskt och socialt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0026-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.363809523809524, "peak": 0.312591552734375, "generation_seconds": 12.813507256098092, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0026-s002", "text": "Hen klarar av uppgifterna och utmaningarna i det dagliga livet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0026-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.851428571428571, "peak": 0.29595947265625, "generation_seconds": 12.535085520008579, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T01:57:24.909466+00:00 hb-c10-folkhalsa tts: PID 65940 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0026-s003", "text": "Hälsa betyder inte bara att en människa inte har någon sjukdom.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0026-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.572789115646258, "peak": 0.283294677734375, "generation_seconds": 10.716322358930483, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0026-s004", "text": "Det är människans förmåga att fungera i vardagen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0026-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.527891156462585, "peak": 0.20611572265625, "generation_seconds": 10.73804425704293, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T01:57:57.847055+00:00 hb-c10-folkhalsa tts: PID 65940 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0027-s001", "text": "En frisk människa klarar av att göra sådant i sitt liv som är meningsfullt för hen, till exempel studera, utöva hobbyer, arbeta eller ha ett socialt liv.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0027-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 12.956734693877552, "peak": 0.33294677734375, "generation_seconds": 22.83071517199278, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0027-s002", "text": "Om en människa blir sjuk eller skadar sig allvarligt kan hen ofta bli tvungen att ge upp sådant som är viktigt för hen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0027-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.170340136054422, "peak": 0.333892822265625, "generation_seconds": 15.614692064002156, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T01:58:30.777025+00:00 hb-c10-folkhalsa tts: PID 65940 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0027-s003", "text": "En människa kan ändå uppleva att hen är handlingskraftig och välmående, trots att hen har en långvarig sjukdom.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0027-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.404081632653062, "peak": 0.329071044921875, "generation_seconds": 14.229973877081648, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0027-s004", "text": "Om sjukdomen behandlas, kan människan leva ett gott liv trots sjukdomen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0027-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.757006802721088, "peak": 0.301025390625, "generation_seconds": 10.055905987042934, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T01:59:03.708596+00:00 hb-c10-folkhalsa tts: PID 65940 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0028-s001", "text": "En del sjukdomar, skador och åkommor är akuta, det vill säga plötsliga, och kortvariga.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0028-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.010884353741497, "peak": 0.3187255859375, "generation_seconds": 11.562569063156843, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0028-s002", "text": "Sådana är till exempel många inflammationer, influensor och skador.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0028-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.199727891156463, "peak": 0.26678466796875, "generation_seconds": 9.398948861053213, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0028-s003", "text": "En del sjukdomar är kroniska, det vill säga långvariga eller bestående.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0028-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.548027210884354, "peak": 0.2763671875, "generation_seconds": 9.508461727993563, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T01:59:36.641251+00:00 hb-c10-folkhalsa tts: PID 65940 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0029-s001", "text": "Många olika faktorer påverkar en människas hälsa.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0029-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.667210884353741, "peak": 0.345703125, "generation_seconds": 7.072550490964204, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0029-s002", "text": "Det är lättare för hen att hålla sig frisk om hen har tillgång till goda hälsovårdstjänster.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0029-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.801904761904762, "peak": 0.36328125, "generation_seconds": 10.712841683067381, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0029-s003", "text": "Tjänsterna hjälper människor att ha ett sunt levnadssätt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0029-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.294149659863946, "peak": 0.295379638671875, "generation_seconds": 8.077735199825838, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T02:00:09.574520+00:00 hb-c10-folkhalsa tts: PID 65940 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0029-s004", "text": "Med hjälp av tjänsterna kan många sjukdomar konstateras i ett tidigt skede och då bättre behandlas.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0029-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.846802721088435, "peak": 0.302276611328125, "generation_seconds": 13.81467840494588, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0030-s001", "text": "Hälsa och välbefinnande främjas också på många andra sätt, till exempel", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0030-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.548027210884354, "peak": 0.2884521484375, "generation_seconds": 10.5105486351531, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0031-s001", "text": "en mångsidig och näringsrik kost", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0031-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.274013605442177, "peak": 0.246490478515625, "generation_seconds": 5.498953579925001, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
