{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0041-s001", "text": "möjlighet att arbeta eller bedriva annan nyttig verksamhet i samhället.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0041-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.2693877551020405, "peak": 0.375274658203125, "generation_seconds": 6.868373650126159, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0042-s001", "text": "Det finländska välfärdssamhället ser på många sätt till att människor håller sig så friska som möjligt.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0042-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.70748299319728, "peak": 0.27392578125, "generation_seconds": 10.768258029129356, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0042-s002", "text": "För det har det stiftats lagar i syfte att främja medborgarnas hälsa.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0042-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.199727891156463, "peak": 0.288848876953125, "generation_seconds": 8.84665233711712, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T02:01:49.302839+00:00 hb-c10-folkhalsa tts: PID 65940 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0042-s003", "text": "Ett exempel är tobakslagen, som begränsar tobaksrökning på offentliga platser.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0042-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.1053061224489795, "peak": 0.29705810546875, "generation_seconds": 10.669443527935073, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0042-s004", "text": "Rökning är ohälsosam och orsakar sjukdomar för rökarna själva och för dem som är tvungna att andas in tobaksröken.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0042-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.379319727891156, "peak": 0.313690185546875, "generation_seconds": 15.568495093844831, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T02:02:19.304009+00:00 hb-c10-folkhalsa tts: PID 65940 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0043-s001", "text": "I Finland samlar man hela tiden in forskningsdata om människors hälsa och sjukdomar.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0043-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.662585034013605, "peak": 0.251190185546875, "generation_seconds": 11.989972098963335, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0043-s002", "text": "Med hjälp av informationen kan man i samhället planera och genomföra program som främjar hälsan.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0043-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.568163265306122, "peak": 0.301239013671875, "generation_seconds": 14.412051814142615, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T02:02:52.890883+00:00 hb-c10-folkhalsa tts: PID 65940 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0043-s003", "text": "Programmen kan gälla till exempel hjärt- och kärlsjukdomar eller cancersjukdomar.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0043-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.244625850340136, "peak": 0.320892333984375, "generation_seconds": 12.361842212965712, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0044-s001", "text": "I Finland arbetar också olika organisationer mycket för att främja hälsa.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0044-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.826666666666667, "peak": 0.41680908203125, "generation_seconds": 13.509766587987542, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T02:03:26.477117+00:00 hb-c10-folkhalsa tts: PID 65940 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0044-s002", "text": "För många långtidssjuka finns egna föreningar som kan ge de sjuka och deras närstående stöd och information.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0044-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.404081632653062, "peak": 0.271331787109375, "generation_seconds": 22.44045544695109, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0045-s001", "text": "Inom den grundläggande utbildningen för barn är hälsokunskap ett separat läroämne.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0045-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.035646258503402, "peak": 0.242767333984375, "generation_seconds": 12.272839532000944, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T02:04:00.064136+00:00 hb-c10-folkhalsa tts: PID 65940 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0045-s002", "text": "Syftet med undervisningen i hälsokunskap är att främja elevernas kunskaper om hälsa, välbefinnande och säkerhet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0045-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.891700680272109, "peak": 0.28558349609375, "generation_seconds": 19.476641074055806, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0046-s001", "text": "Människornas hälsa observeras också med hjälp av screeningar.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0046-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.851428571428571, "peak": 0.275848388671875, "generation_seconds": 12.853166757849976, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T02:04:33.648472+00:00 hb-c10-folkhalsa tts: PID 65940 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0046-s002", "text": "En screening är en undersökning där man letar efter tecken på allvarlig sjukdom.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0046-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.896326530612245, "peak": 0.33331298828125, "generation_seconds": 15.227896438911557, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0046-s003", "text": "Exempel på sådana sjukdomar kan vara till exempel livmoderhalscancer, bröstcancer eller tarmcancer.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0046-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.986122448979591, "peak": 0.30767822265625, "generation_seconds": 21.616324546048418, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T02:05:07.235394+00:00 hb-c10-folkhalsa tts: PID 65940 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0046-s004", "text": "Behandlingsresultaten blir bättre när sjukdomar upptäcks i ett tidigt skede.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0046-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.6873469387755105, "peak": 0.280517578125, "generation_seconds": 14.167814103886485, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T02:05:40.822553+00:00 hb-c10-folkhalsa tts: PID 65940 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0047-s001", "text": "I Finland är det lätt att hitta information om hur man främjar sin hälsa och sitt välbefinnande till exempel på internet, biblioteken, hos läkaren eller olika hälsoorganisationer.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0047-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 15.116190476190477, "peak": 0.33819580078125, "generation_seconds": 30.209172637900338, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T02:06:14.412898+00:00 hb-c10-folkhalsa tts: PID 65940 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0047-s002", "text": "Dessutom erbjuder välfärdsområdena och olika organisationer och företag många olika slags vårdtjänster, motionsgrenar, välbefinnanderådgivning och kostrådgivning samt olika kulturtjänster.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0047-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 16.021768707482995, "peak": 0.29486083984375, "generation_seconds": 32.52140466682613, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0047-s003", "text": "De hjälper folk att hålla sig friska och må bra.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0047-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.31891156462585, "peak": 0.349212646484375, "generation_seconds": 7.616485872073099, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T02:06:47.999282+00:00 hb-c10-folkhalsa tts: PID 65940 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0047-s004", "text": "För barn är skolan en viktig uppväxtmiljö som ger deras vardag struktur och där de också lär sig att främja hälsa och välbefinnande.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0047-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.493877551020407, "peak": 0.32867431640625, "generation_seconds": 18.405584040097892, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0048-s001", "text": "I Finland kan barnen vaccineras (rokotus) mot många smittsamma sjukdomar.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0048-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 6.6873469387755105, "peak": 0.38592529296875, "generation_seconds": 10.461601499002427, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T02:07:21.585382+00:00 hb-c10-folkhalsa tts: PID 65940 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0048-s002", "text": "Vaccinationerna ges på barnrådgivningen (lastenneuvola) och inom skolhälsovården.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0048-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.244625850340136, "peak": 0.33367919921875, "generation_seconds": 12.51617120904848, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0048-s003", "text": "De vaccinationer som ingår i vaccinationsprogrammet är avgiftsfria för familjen.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0048-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.174965986394557, "peak": 0.316070556640625, "generation_seconds": 13.604856539983302, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0048-s004", "text": "Vaccinationerna är frivilliga.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0048-s004.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.274013605442177, "peak": 0.32891845703125, "generation_seconds": 6.387241821037605, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T02:07:55.171237+00:00 hb-c10-folkhalsa tts: PID 65940 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0048-s005", "text": "De flesta barn i Finland får de vaccinationer som ingår i vaccinationsprogrammet.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0048-s005.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.244625850340136, "peak": 0.34332275390625, "generation_seconds": 12.0522902070079, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0048-s006", "text": "Berätta för hälsovårdaren vilka vaccinationer ditt barn har fått innan ni kom till Finland.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0048-s006.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.9412244897959186, "peak": 0.32427978515625, "generation_seconds": 13.470234876964241, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T02:08:28.753491+00:00 hb-c10-folkhalsa tts: PID 65940 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0049-s001", "text": "I Finland finns ett vaccinationsprogram, enligt vilket alla barn erbjuds kostnadsfria vaccinationer mot fler livsfarliga sjukdomar.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0049-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.633197278911565, "peak": 0.64935302734375, "generation_seconds": 19.36132117197849, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0049-s002", "text": "Vaccinationer erbjuds mot bland annat polio, stelkramp, difteri, kikhosta, mässling och påssjuka.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0049-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.777142857142858, "peak": 0.360595703125, "generation_seconds": 13.863769549876451, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T02:09:02.341497+00:00 hb-c10-folkhalsa tts: PID 65940 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0050-s001", "text": "Om du ingår i en riskgrupp för influensa, kan du också få en kostnadsfri vaccination mot influensa.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0050-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 8.777142857142858, "peak": 0.284393310546875, "generation_seconds": 14.206171045079827, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0050-s002", "text": "Detta gäller för både vuxna och barn.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0050-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 3.4829931972789114, "peak": 0.291412353515625, "generation_seconds": 6.508823890937492, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0051-s001", "text": "När du flyttar till Finland ska du ta reda på vilka vaccinationer enligt vaccinationsprogrammet du saknar.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0051-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.334421768707482, "peak": 0.41650390625, "generation_seconds": 15.698794692987576, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T02:09:35.926385+00:00 hb-c10-folkhalsa tts: PID 65940 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0051-s002", "text": "Om du inte har fått alla vaccinationer enligt vaccinationsprogrammet kan du få dem kostnadsfritt om du flyttar till Finland stadigvarande.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0051-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 11.981496598639456, "peak": 0.43603515625, "generation_seconds": 17.360614540986717, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
2026-11-03T02:10:09.512676+00:00 hb-c10-folkhalsa tts: PID 65940 running
{"sentence_id": "hb-c10-u0052-s001", "text": "Om du har ansökt om asyl eller tillfälligt skydd i Finland kan du få vaccinationerna om du är minderårig eller gravid.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c10-folkhalsa/narration/hb-c10-u0052-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.588299319727891, "peak": 0.29339599609375, "generation_seconds": 14.793260058853775, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
